	'messages:nosuchsectiontitle' => 'guw:Adà ma yin mimọ',
	'messages:nosuchsectiontext' => 'guw:A tẹnpọn nado vọ́ adà he ma tin de jlado. E sọgan ko yin tẹnsẹna kavi yin súnsúnsún sẹ̀ to whenue a gbẹ po to adà lọ pọ́n.',
	'messages:loginreqtitle' => 'guw:A dona hùn adà towe',
	'messages:loginreqlink' => 'guw:hùn adà towe',
	'messages:loginreqpagetext' => 'guw:Jaale $1 nado pọn weda devo lẹ.',
	'messages:accmailtitle' => 'guw:Họnhungan yin sisẹ hlan',
	'messages:accmailtext' => 'guw:Họnhungan he ma yín awuwlena de ko yin dide na [[User talk:$1|$1]] ko yin sisẹ́do $2. E sọgan yin didiọ to <em>[[Special:ChangePassword|change password]]</em> eyin a ko hùn adà towe.',
	'messages:newarticle' => 'guw:(Yọyọ)',
	'messages:newarticletext' => 'guw:A ko biọ nọtẹn he ma ko yin awuwledaina dé mẹ, nado wleawuna adà ehe, kanwe dó apotin he tin odo lọ mẹ (pọn [$1 weda alọgọ tọn] na nudọnamẹ dogọ).
Eyin e ma yin fi wẹ a ja, zin ohia <strong>yigodo</strong> tọn.',
	'messages:anontalkpagetext' => 'guw:----
<em>Weda hodọdopọ tọn na mẹhe ma ko hùn adà intẹnẹt tọn ehe lẹ, kavi mẹhe ma nọ zan nọtẹn ehe lẹ.</em>
Todin mi na nọ yi wekunsọha IP tọn lẹ do dè yé do voovo.
Mẹsusu wẹ sọgan ma adlẹsi IP tọn ehe lọ pé.
Eyin a ma nọ zan nọtẹn intẹnẹt tọn ehe bọ a lẹndọ mẹde sẹ́ nuhe ma do yizan nawe de do we, jaale [[Special:CreateAccount|Hùn adà yọyọ dé]] kavi [[Special:UserLogin|hùn adà towe]] nado dapana bẹwlu po zinzantọ he ma do adà lẹpo to nukọn mẹ.',
	'messages:noarticletext' => 'guw:Wekinkan depope ma tin to weda ehe mẹ to alọnu.
A sọgan [[Special:Search/{{PAGENAME}}|dìn hogo weda ehe tọn]] to weda devo lẹ mẹ,
<span class="plainlinks">[{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} dìn kandai he dí lẹ], kavi [{{fullurl:{{FULLPAGENAME}}|action=edit}}dá weda ehe]</span>.',
	'messages:noarticletext-nopermission' => 'guw:Nukinkan depope ma tin to weda ehe mẹ.
A sọgan [[Special:Search/{{PAGENAME}}|dín yinkọ weda lọ tọn]] to weda devo lẹ mẹ, kavi <span class="plainlinks">[{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} dín kandai he gandoego lẹ]</span>, ṣigba a ma do jlọjẹ nado hẹn weda ehe wa aimẹ.',
	'messages:missing-revision-permission' => 'guw:Zepon #$1 tọn yin na weda he he ko yin didesẹ de. A sọgan pọn [{{fullurl:{{#Special:Undelete}}|target=$3&timestamp=$2&diff=prev}} view it]; nudọnamẹ lẹ sọgan yin mimọ to  [{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}/delete|page=$3}} deletion log].',
	'messages:missing-revision' => 'guw:Zepọn #$1 tọn na weda he nọ yin yiylọdọ "{{FULLPAGENAME}}" ma tin.


Ehe nọ saba jọ gbọn hihodo alọdlẹndonu gbigble whenuho de tọn he yin ṣiṣaka do weda he ko yin didesẹ de go.
Nudọnamẹ lẹ sọgan yin mimọ to [{{fullurl:{{#Special:Log}}/delete|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} deletion log].',
	'messages:missing-revision-content' => 'guw:Hosọ he tin na zepọn #$1 to nọtẹn lọ he yin yiylọdọ "$2" ma sọgan hùn.',
