	'messages:api-pageset-param-revids' => 'en:A list of revision IDs to work on. Note that almost all query modules will convert revision IDs to the corresponding page ID and work on the latest revision instead. Only <kbd>prop=revisions</kbd> uses exact revisions for its response.',
	'messages:api-pageset-param-generator' => 'en:Get the list of pages to work on by executing the specified query module.

